OL,3,GNEWSAParents say toddler found in
OL,4,Amiddle of main road after wandering off
OL,5,Afrom nursery
OL,6,
OL,7,FParents who claim their toddler
OL,8,Fwandered off from nursery and was found
OL,9,Fby a stranger on a busy road say they
OL,10,Fhave been left traumatised.
OL,12,FSarah Durgan, 22, and Tarik Al Roshoq,
OL,13,F24, from Swansea, said their
OL,14,Ftwo-year-old son Noah was found on his
OL,15,Fown on Gors Avenue, Mayhill.
OL,17,F"He could have been hit by a car, a
OL,18,Fbus, he could have been taken," Al
OL,19,FRoshoq said.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
